<title>UK: London shipsales.</title>
<headline>London shipsales.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Secondhand tonnage brokers reported the sale of the following vessels.</p>
<p>TANKERS - Panam Querida - (built 1983) sold to Greek buyers for $7.5 million.</p>
<p>Osprey Sky - (built 1985) 9,306 dwt sold for $10 million including three years timecharter $9,000 daily.</p>
<p>TWEENDECKERS - Lincoln K - (built 1977) 14,904 dwt sold for $2.3 million.</p>
<p>Lindeborg - (built 1982) 5,412 dwt sold to Swedish buyers for $3.78 million.</p>
<p>Some of these sales may not be final.</p>
</text>
